the kitchen be enough to carve out a new destiny?\u003c/p\u003e","cover":"https://cdn.asurascans.com/asura-images/covers/the-academys-sashimi-sword-master.7f20f6.webp","status":"ongoing","type":"manhwa","author":"GMAN","artist":"Soo Comics","popularity_rank":41,"bookmark_count":63054,"rating":9.341806381828015,"chapter_count":105,"last_chapter_at":"2026-11-20T11:50:13.817687Z","created_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","updated_at":"2026-11-22T10:01:42.447559Z","public_url":"/comics/the-academys-sashimi-sword-master-7ba78ec7","source_url":"/s/2185","genres":[{"id":1,"name":"Action","slug":"action"},{"id":4,"name":"Adventure","slug":"adventure"},{"id":16,"name":"Fantasy","slug":"fantasy"}],"latest_chapters":[{"id":263399,"series_id":0,"number":104,"title":"Student Council President Election (3)","slug":"chapter-104","page_count":0,"is_premium":false,"comments_enabled":false,"early_access_until":"2026-11-20T17:50:13.817687Z","published_at":"2026-11-20T11:50:13.817687Z","view_count":0,"created_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z"},{"id":262908,"series_id":0,"number":103,"title":"Selection (2)","slug":"chapter-103","page_count":0,"is_premium":false,"comments_enabled":false,"early_access_until":"2026-11-13T02:33:22.67162Z","published_at":"2026-11-12T20:33:22.67162Z","view_count":0,"created_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z"},{"id":262783,"series_id":0,"number":102,"title":"Selection (1)","slug":"chapter-102","page_count":0,"is_premium":false,"comments_enabled":false,"early_access_until":"2026-11-07T08:59:31.04776Z","published_at":"2026-11-07T02:59:31.04776Z","view_count":0,"created_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z"}],"linked_novel":{"id":61,"title":"The Academy’s Sashimi Sword Master","slug":"the-academy-s-sashimi-sword-master","cover_url":"https://cdn.asurascans.com/asura-images/covers/the-academy-s-sashimi-sword-master.c71379.webp","chapter_count":211,"status":"ongoing"}},{"id":2161,"slug":"emperor-of-solo-play","title":"Emperor of Solo Play","alt_titles":["孤独《ソロプレイ》の帝王","單刷王者","솔플의 제왕","ราชาแห่งโซโล่เพลเยอร์","单刷之王","The King of Soloplay","The Emperor of Solo Play"],"description":"\u003cp\u003eThe launch of the virtual reality game Warlord in the year 2035 changed the world.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eAhn Jaehyun was one of many who sought to change his fate within it.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eBut the price of devoting his entire life to the game was betrayal by the very comrades he trusted the most.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eHaving lost everything because of that betrayal, Jaehyun is given one more chance to start over.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\"I'm never playing with others again. Whether I win or lose, I'll do it all on my own, and show them exactly what that means.\"\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eWhile others roll dice to split the loot, Jaehyun is the one who takes it all for himself.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eAnd so begins his thrilling, ruthless, solo-kill gaming life!\u003c/p\u003e","cover":"https://cdn.asurascans.com/asura-images/covers/emperor-of-solo-play.0d7530.webp","banner":"https://cdn.asurascans.com/asura-images/banners/emperor-of-solo-play.jpg","status":"ongoing","type":"manhwa","author":"Dedart","artist":"Redice Studio","popularity_rank":140,"bookmark_count":20179,"rating":8.106442577030812,"chapter_count":93,"last_chapter_at":"2026-11-19T18:11:14.757673Z","created_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","updated_at":"2026-11-22T10:01:42.447559Z","public_url":"/comics/emperor-of-solo-play-7ba78ec7","source_url":"/s/2161","genres":[{"id":1,"name":"Action","slug":"action"},{"id":4,"name":"Adventure","slug":"adventure"},{"id":7,"name":"Comedy","slug":"comedy"},{"id":16,"name":"Fantasy","slug":"fantasy"}],"latest_chapters":[{"id":263383,"series_id":0,"number":93,"slug":"chapter-93","page_count":0,"is_premium":false,"comments_enabled":false,"early_access_until":"2026-11-20T00:11:14.757673Z","published_at":"2026-11-19T18:11:14.757673Z","view_count":0,"created_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z"},{"id":262848,"series_id":0,"number":92,"slug":"chapter-92","page_count":0,"is